.TH FUTEX_VALUE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
futex_value \- invokes linux futex with an integer fourth argument, for operations such as futex_requeue and futex_wake_op
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/futex.h>
.B int futex_value(int* address, int operation, unsigned int value, unsigned long value2, int* address2, unsigned int value3);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes Linux futex with an integer fourth argument, for operations such as FUTEX_REQUEUE and FUTEX_WAKE_OP. Futex words must be aligned 32-bit integers.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR futex (2)
